STORYBOUND ARCHIVE — GITHUB PAGES FILES

Upload the contents of the "blog" folder into a folder named "blog" in theproperlexicon/author.

Keep the finished blog post HTML files in a separate root-level folder named "blogposts":

author/
  blog/
    index.html
    blog.css
    books.js
    assets/
  blogposts/
    aboutme.html
    dragonflies.html
    skywards.html
    freefall.html
    stars-shine-darkly.html
    we-would-be-gods.html

The public blog homepage will be:
https://lexilavene.com/blog/

Finished posts will be linked at:
https://lexilavene.com/blogposts/story-name.html

TO PUBLISH A NEW ENTRY

1. Add its HTML file to the blogposts folder using the exact filename already listed in blog/books.js.
2. Open blog/books.js.
3. Change that entry from status: "coming-soon" to status: "published".
4. Commit both changes.

The card will automatically change color, become clickable, and say "Read the archive."
